OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers describe 'chaotic' air
OL,4,Atraffic problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FAir passengers at Jersey Airport have
OL,7,Fdescribed "chaotic" situations caused
OL,8,Fby disruption to flights.
OL,10,FA technical problem with air traffic
OL,11,Fcontrol in the UK has led to hundreds
OL,12,Fof thousands of people facing delays
OL,13,Fand cancellations.
OL,15,FWendy Bellamy, who had to stay in
OL,16,FJersey for an extra two nights to wait
OL,17,Ffor another flight to East Midlands
OL,18,FAirport, said it had been "very
OL,19,Fstressful and very difficult".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
